msgctxt "Addon Summary"
msgid "Lactea - a pure-Rust MilkDrop / projectM music visualizer"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "Addon Description"
msgid "Lactea is a MilkDrop 2/3 and projectM-compatible music visualizer written in Rust on wgpu. It reads the whole .milk preset format (custom waves and shapes, per-frame and per-vertex code, warp and composite shaders) and renders them in real time to the music you are hearing. Point it at a folder of presets and it does the rest."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "Addon Disclaimer"
msgid "Requires a GPU with Vulkan, Metal or DX12 support (lavapipe works in software)."
msgstr ""

